    {
      "rule_id": "MW-006",
      "fault_family": "mechanical_wear",
      "description": "TIMING_RETARDED chemistry overlap \u2014 Tier B gap closer: low compression from mechanical wear causes late/incomplete combustion \u2192 TIMING_RETARDED chemistry as a secondary effect. Chemistry: TIMING_RETARDED as SUGGESTIVE evidence. Gated on DTC none_present for VVT_HISTORY range (P0010-P0025) \u2014 NO VVT DTCs may be present. This is the cam_timing differentiator: cam_timing TIMING_RETARDED cases carry VVT codes; mechanical_wear TIMING_RETARDED cases do not (the timing retardation is from sealing failure, not VVT malfunction). confidence_ceiling applied because TIMING_RETARDED chemistry is shared across 7 families. v1 had no equivalent rule (TIMING_RETARDED had zero v1 registrations)",
